,p_attribute_type=>'SELECT LIST'
,p_is_required=>true
,p_default_value=>'aurora'
,p_escape_mode=>'ATTR'
,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_lov_type=>'STATIC'
,p_help_text=>'Visual design of the hero, each followed by its Next Collection direction. Aurora, motion: slow aurora ribbons behind a centered headline with aurora text. Meteors, motion: night panel from the primary color with a meteor shower and a glowing horizon. Grid Spotlight, motion: a grid revealed by a spotlight that follows the pointer and drifts when idle. Retro Grid, depth: perspective floor grid scrolling toward a striped horizon sun. Parallax Layers, depth: headline beside floating layered shapes and an icon tile that shift with the pointer. Kinetic Type, bold: oversized headline with an outlined highlight swept by light. Neo Brutal, bold: flat tint, ink border, hard offset shadow and sticker label. Mesh Grain, bold: mesh gradient with film grain. Split Morph, smart: container queries switch between split, centered and compact bar compositions. Scroll Reveal, smart: headline words reveal as the hero scrolls into view, fully visible where scroll-driven animation is not supported.'
);
